; Busy-wait delay
;
; Spins BC times in a four-instruction loop (26 T-states per pass). Used by the
; main loop of #R$69A4 to set the game speed: the larger BC, the slower the
; game. BC=0 gives 65536 passes.
; Hardware: timing loop, no screen or port access (the CPU speed sets the
; delay).
;
; BC Number of loop passes
; O:BC 0
@label=Delay
c$6B0C DEC BC        ;
 $6B0D LD A,B        ;
 $6B0E OR C          ;
 $6B0F JR NZ,$6B0C   ;
 $6B11 RET           ;
